  "description": {
   "en": "Saionji Miharuta has just been assigned as the new editor for the hot-selling novelist, Shinonome Jin. Shinonome is an author who's veiled in mystery and has never shown his face to the public. So, when Saionji went for their first meeting, he was shocked to find himself in his current life's greatest crisis!!\n\nWas this reunion a fated one, or was it predestined!?"
  },
